but you can't make an omelet without breaking some eggs. In the case of the Penn South Cooperative, the broken eggs were 354 homes demolished, 183 stores raised, and nearly 2,000 residents evicted. Those evicted residents could apply to live in the new cooperative buildings, but a lot of people couldn't afford it.
但是不做 omelet（煎蛋）就打不碎鸡蛋。就宾夕法尼亚南区合作公寓而言，被打碎的“鸡蛋”是354栋被拆除的住宅、183家被铲平的商店，以及近2000名被驱逐的居民。那些被驱逐的居民可以申请入住新的合作公寓，但很多人根本负担不起。

