like just another bad landlord? Yes. Yeah. They'd been duped by the United Housing Foundation. And they found the United Housing Foundation very condescending. Because if you were a resident and you went to the United Housing Foundation and you said, hey, I don't like the amount this costs or the air conditioning in my apartment isn't working or whatever complaint you had, there was this whole sort of like, you don't understand what it means to be in a cooperative. The residents of Coop City were in no mood to hear the U.S. HF's lecturing on the collective sacrifices required to live in a cooperative.
就像另一个糟糕的房东？是的。是的。他们被联合住房基金会愚弄了。他们觉得联合住房基金会非常居高临下。因为如果你是一个居民，你去找联合住房基金会说，嘿，我不喜欢这个费用或者我公寓里的空调坏了，或者你有任何投诉，就会有一种“你不懂什么是合作公寓”的姿态。合作城的居民根本没有心情听UHF长篇大论地宣扬住在合作公寓所需的集体牺牲。

